# iCloud conflict copies. This repository lives in an iCloud-synced folder, which
# renames a losing copy to "name 2.ext" instead of prompting. There are 196 of
# them on disk right now and none are tracked; ignoring the pattern keeps a
# `git add -A` from ever picking one up and committing a stale duplicate of a
# file that is also being edited for real.
* [0-9].*
* [0-9]
